=== P4 ANALYSIS: ORCHARD NOTE SPENT INTO IRONWOOD (TWO BUNDLES) ===
--- 1. Crate Architecture Support ---
- orchard crate: BundleVersion::orchard_v3() (Orchard pool) and BundleVersion::ironwood_v3() (Ironwood pool)
- orchard::builder::Builder builds ONE bundle at a time for a single pool version.
- Two distinct bundles require two separate Builder instances.
- zcash_primitives::transaction::TransactionData::from_parts_v6 explicitly supports BOTH:
    orchard_bundle: Option<orchard::Bundle<A::OrchardAuth, ZatBalance>>
    ironwood_bundle: Option<orchard::Bundle<A::OrchardAuth, ZatBalance>>
- V6 sighash (v6_signature_hash) commits to both orchard_digest and ironwood_digest.
- Wire serialization (write_v6) writes orchard_bundle followed by ironwood_bundle.

